<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Synthetic Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Defaulting to serif for formal look */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-logo-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo-left, .logo-right {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .logo-right img {
    max-width: 120px; /* Placeholder for logo size */
    height: auto;
  }
  .title-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .title-section h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .sub-heading {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .list-item {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo-container">
    <div class="logo-left">
      <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">NIT Trichy's</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 48pt; font-weight: bold;">pragyan</span>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: -10px;">AN ISO 9001 AND 20121 CERTIFIED ORGANISATION</div>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-right">
      <!-- Placeholder for Institute Logo -->
      <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <div>
      Ph. +<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Website: <a href="http://www.pragyan.org"><span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></a>
    </div>
    <div>
      Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="title-section">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) FOR PRAGYAN 2020 FOOD STALLS</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">DATED: <span data-field="date_issued">{{ date_issued }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Ref. No: <span data-field="reference_number">{{ reference_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;">
    <span data-field="organizer_name">{{ organizer_name }}</span>, the Annual Inter Collegiate Techno-managerial fest of <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span> invites Expression of Interest from reputed Indian Organizations/ Corporate Agencies/ Vendors to set up food stalls during <span data-field="event_name">{{ event_name }}</span> (<span data-field="date_range_start">{{ date_range_start }}</span> to <span data-field="date_range_end">{{ date_range_end }}</span>) in the Institute campus for the benefit of Residents & Participants of <span data-field="event_year">{{ event_year }}</span>.
  </p>

  <div class="section-heading">Food Stall Details:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">1. The timings of the food stall will be as follows:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Date</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Timings</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>1</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_date_1">{{ stall_date_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_time_1">{{ stall_time_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_date_2">{{ stall_date_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_time_2">{{ stall_time_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_date_3">{{ stall_date_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_time_3">{{ stall_time_3 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>4</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_date_4">{{ stall_date_4 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_time_4">{{ stall_time_4 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">2. The Food sales will happen in two modes as follows:</p>
  <div class="sub-heading">A. Food card sales:</div>
  <ol>
    <li class="list-item">Students of <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span> are issued food cards worth <span data-field="food_card_value">{{ food_card_value }}</span>.</li>
    <li class="list-item">Each vendor will be provided with a computer connected to the server. The software will display all menu items along with the prices.</li>
    <li class="list-item">Vendors can make sales with the software. The software will have provisions for the vendor to keep track of the sale amount.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="sub-heading">B. Cash Sales:</div>
  <ol>
    <li class="list-item">Vendors can accept cash from students/ visitors.</li>
    <li class="list-item">The amount collected shall be in accordance with the prices specified in the Menu.</li>
    <li class="list-item">Online payments/ UPI Payments (Includes, but not limited to G-Pay, BHIM, PayTM, PhonePe )</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo-container">
    <div class="logo-left">
      <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">NIT Trichy's</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 48pt; font-weight: bold;">pragyan</span>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: -10px;">AN ISO 9001 AND 20121 CERTIFIED ORGANISATION</div>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-right">
      <!-- Placeholder for Institute Logo -->
      <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <div>
      Ph. +<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Website: <a href="http://www.pragyan.org"><span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></a>
    </div>
    <div>
      Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">3. The list of cuisines and corresponding stall details are as follows:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Stall type/ Cuisine</th>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Menu items</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in stall_menu_items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_menu_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].stall_type">{{ stall_menu_items[loop.index0].stall_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_menu_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].menu_items">{{ stall_menu_items[loop.index0].menu_items }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Stall Size Details:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">3. The infrastructure required (Shed, Tables, etc.) will be provided by Pragyan, NIT Trichy. Water requirements should be provided in advance by the vendor and should be categorized as water for drinking or washing.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">4. The selected applicant will be provided with stall of one of the following sizes based on the number of items being served and the rent being paid:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Stall Size (in feet)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for size in stall_sizes %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="stall_sizes[{{ loop.index0 }}].size">{{ stall_sizes[loop.index0].size }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Terms:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li class="list-item">Selected vendors shall pay a caution deposit of <span data-field="caution_deposit_amount">{{ caution_deposit_amount }}</span>, only after which their respective stall will be set up.</li>
    <li class="list-item">All workers in the food stall should compulsarily wear hand gloves, head masks, and other necessary equipment/clothing. If the vendor fails to do so, Pragyan will provide the same. The cost of the same will be deducted from the caution deposit paid.</li>
    <li class="list-item">Menu/ selling price should not deviate from the prices specified in the acceptance letter. Any deviation of any deviation, a fine of <span data-field="fine_amount">{{ fine_amount }}</span> will be levied.</li>
    <li class="list-item">All vendors should submit the bill of the RFID card sales on or before <span data-field="bill_submission_date">{{ bill_submission_date }}</span>.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="sub-heading">Interested Vendors shall submit the following:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li class="list-item">Annexure - I</li>
    <li class="list-item">List of Menu items along with Selling Price</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo-container">
    <div class="logo-left">
      <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">NIT Trichy's</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 48pt; font-weight: bold;">pragyan</span>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: -10px;">AN ISO 9001 AND 20121 CERTIFIED ORGANISATION</div>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-right">
      <!-- Placeholder for Institute Logo -->
      <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <div>
      Ph. +<span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Website: <a href="http://www.pragyan.org"><span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></a>
    </div>
    <div>
      Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Payment Details:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">4. Successful vendors need to submit a DD with the amount equal to sum of the quoted rent and the caution deposit of <span data-field="total_deposit_amount">{{ total_deposit_amount }}</span> (For example, if the quoted rent is ₹60,000, then the DD should have the amount as ₹65,000) and it should be addressed to:</p>
  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Account Name:</td>
      <td><span data-field="account_name">{{ account_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Account Number:</td>
      <td><span data-field="account_number">{{ account_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Bank:</td>
      <td><span data-field="bank_name">{{ bank_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Branch:</td>
      <td><span data-field="branch_name">{{ branch_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>IFSC:</td>
      <td><span data-field="ifsc_code">{{ ifsc_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-heading">Deadline:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Last date of Submission of Eoi (On or before): <span data-field="submission_deadline">{{ submission_deadline }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Annexure - I</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">DETAILED DOCUMENT FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) DURING PRAGYAN 2020 AT NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY, TRICHY – 620015</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-heading">CUISINE:</div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">NAME OF VENDOR</td>
        <td style="width: 50%;"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>SIZE OF STALL</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3</td>
        <td>PERIOD</td>
        <td>FROM: <span data-field="annexure_from_date">{{ annexure_from_date }}</span> TO: <span data-field="annexure_to_date">{{ annexure_to_date }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>4</td>
        <td>TOTAL RENT PAYABLE BY THE VENDOR FOR ONE STALL OF THE SIZE INDICATED ABOVE</td>
        <td>RS. <span data-field="total_rent_payable">{{ total_rent_payable }}</span> FOR ALL 4 DAYS</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">AUTHORIZED SIGNATURE OF VENDOR</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">NAME OF THE SIGNATORY:</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt;">OFFICIAL SEAL</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>